"ctx": "Fables102/env_triptrapbar_confrontation",
"en": "[being pushed through doors] Ow!"
},
{
"k": "15389",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_triptrapbar_confrontation",
"en": "[being pushed] {worrieda}Ow! Fuck!"
},
{
"k": "15390",
"who": "HOLLY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_triptrapbar_confrontation",
"en": "Some old world shit will fuck your soul up. [morbidly chuckles]"
},
{
"k": "15391",
"who": "HOLLY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_triptrapbar_confrontation",
"en": "We burn our dead by sunrise or… I dunno."
},
{
"k": "15392",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_triptrapbar_confrontation",
"en": "[pickup2][quietly firm] All right. Clear out."
},
{
"k": "15393",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_triptrapbar_confrontation",
"en": "[pickup2][quietly firm] Give her some room."
},
{
"k": "15394",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_triptrapbar_confrontation",
"en": "Good call, Snow."
},
{
"k": "15395",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_triptrapbar_confrontation",
"en": "Pudding and Pie?"
},
{
"k": "15396",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_triptrapbar_confrontation",
"en": "Fees?"
},
{
"k": "15397",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_triptrapbar_confrontation",
"en": "[pickup2][low, just to Bigby] {NormalA} We can just go check it out."
},
{
"k": "15398",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_triptrapbar_confrontation",
"en": "[pickup2]{ThinkingA} Pudding and Pie, huh? {NormalB} What do you know about the place?"
},
{
"k": "15399",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_triptrapbar_confrontation",
"en": "[pickup2]{ThinkingA} Georgie, huh?"
},
{
"k": "15400",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_triptrapbar_confrontation",
"en": "[pickup2]{ThinkingB} Not the first time I've heard that name."
},
{
"k": "15401",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_triptrapbar_confrontation",
"en": "[pickup2]{NormalB} What do you know about him?"
},
{
"k": "15402",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_triptrapbar_confrontation",
"en": "[pickup2][low, just to Bigby]{ThinkingA} We can just go talk to him."
},
{
"k": "15403",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_triptrapbar_confrontation",
"en": "[pickup2][low, just to Bigby]{ThinkingA} Sounds like one of those old \"company store\" kinds of ploys, {NormalA}designed to entrap people by keeping them in debt."
},
{
"k": "15404",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_triptrapbar_confrontation",
"en": "[pickup2]{ThinkingA} Fees, huh? {NormalA} What kind of fees?"
},
{
"k": "15405",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_triptrapbar_confrontation",
"en": "[pickup2][low, just to Bigby]{ThinkingB} We can probably learn more at the club."
},
{
"k": "15406",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_triptrapbar_confrontation",
"en": "[pickup2][low, just to Bigby][concerned about distressing Holly any further]{NormalA} We've got a lead. {ThinkingB} Maybe we can take it from here?"
},
{
"k": "15407",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_triptrapbar_confrontation",
"en": "[pickup2]{NormalA}If it's too much, we don't have to do this."
},
{
"k": "15408",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_triptrapbar_confrontation",
"en": "[pickup2]{WorriedA}Holly, it's OK."
},
{
"k": "15409",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_triptrapbar_confrontation",
"en": "Why weren't you talking?"
},
{
"k": "15410",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_triptrapbar_confrontation",
"en": "[Let Jack talk]"
},
{
"k": "15411",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "That could be part of the glamour, if it went on recently enough."
},
{
"k": "15412",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "She's even wearing the exact outfit I've got on today."
},
{
"k": "15413",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "What does that even mean?"
},
{
"k": "15414",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "It's just creepy, that's all. It's a dead person in my clothes. In my skin."
},
{
"k": "15415",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Why would anyone… DO that?"
},
{
"k": "15416",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[creeped out]ugh"
},
{
"k": "15417",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I wonder if we shouldn't regulate glamours more strongly than we do."
},
{
"k": "15418",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Yes, thank you, I… yes.  It's like someone's stolen me from myself, and I don't know how to undo that."
},
{
"k": "15419",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "It's the worst kind of theft, isn't it?"
},
{
"k": "15420",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I'm just glad it ISN'T you. Working together recently… well, you've been…"
},
{
"k": "15421",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "To kill you. [to group]If, in fact, Miss White was chosen deliberately rather than randomly."
},
{
"k": "15422",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Of course, they might try again."
},
{
"k": "15423",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "If someone wants to kill me, it could be… [getting flustered]I don't know, an old grudge? Something about my job? I just DON'T KNOW, I don't know why. Jesus, what am I supposed to do with this?"
},
{
"k": "15424",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Is there anything going on in your personal life we should know about?"
},
{
"k": "15425",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "My personal life is just fine, thank you very much."
},
{
"k": "15426",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "That's already too many mouths. We'll never keep it secret."
},
{
"k": "15427",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "How many people outside this room actually know you're alive?"
},
{
"k": "15428",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Let me think. Beast came to the office, he almost had a heart attack. Bufkin, Grimble, and Trusty John. The Woodsman, of course…"
},
{
"k": "15429",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "You should stay protected and out of sight. Don't leave the business office until this is over."
},
{
"k": "15430",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "That doesn't seem necessary. And I don't like the idea of hiding. I won't live in fear."
},
{
"k": "15431",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[sighing]I don't know. Bigby, what do you think?"
},
{
"k": "15432",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I agree. Go about your normal business. We can use you as bait to draw out the killer!"
},
{
"k": "15433",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Best to be cautious. Stay out of sight for now."
},
{
"k": "15434",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "But we still don't know what this is about."
},
{
"k": "15435",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Fine. If it will get this done correctly."
},
{
"k": "15436",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "What? I'm not an errand boy."
},
{
"k": "15437",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "You? Someone should fetch Swineheart."
},
{
"k": "15438",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Maybe the body can tell us something. [to Bluebeard]Give me some room, I'll check her over."
},
{
"k": "15439",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "The cut is unnaturally clean."
},
{
"k": "15440",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Looks that way."
},
{
"k": "15441",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Is it the same as the other one?"
},
{
"k": "15442",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "You can't fool this nose."
},
{
"k": "15443",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "How would she know… how do YOU know what perfume I wear?"
},
{
"k": "15444",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "She got your perfume right."
},
{
"k": "15445",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "She's wearing the perfume."
},
{
"k": "15446",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Is that significant?"
},
{
"k": "15447",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "It's expensive, she wouldn't want to waste it."
},
{
"k": "15448",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Clothes are stained. Not as much blood as you'd expect with a beheading."
},
{
"k": "15449",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "The skin here is unusual."
},
{
"k": "15450",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[worried]Is it some kind of… disease?"
},
{
"k": "15451",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "It could be that."
},
{
"k": "15452",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "She was in the river?"
},
{
"k": "15453",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Yeah. A kid found her."
},
{
"k": "15454",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Woodsman did say he'd thrown her there…"
},
{
"k": "15455",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Judging by the perfume and the blood, I'd say she can't have been in the water very long."
},
{
"k": "15456",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "There's an indentation here, and some fibers. Tied up with rope, I think."
},
{
"k": "15457",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I'm not sure what the clinical difference looks like."
},
{
"k": "15458",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "After she died, or… before?"
},
{
"k": "15459",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "However…"
},
{
"k": "15460",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[a little disappointed]Oh."
},
{
"k": "15461",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Her fist is clenched."
},
{
"k": "15462",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "So she fought back?"
},
{
"k": "15463",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "No marks on the knuckles."
},
{
"k": "15464",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Maybe, they were weighting her down."
},
{
"k": "15465",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Nobody was worried about her untying herself, because she was already dead."
},
{
"k": "15466",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "She might be holding something.  I'll see if I can…"
},
{
"k": "15467",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Seriously?"
},
{
"k": "15468",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[stepping forward] I should take custody of it. It's evidence."
},
{
"k": "15469",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Surreal. What are we supposed to do with that?"
},
{
"k": "15470",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "There's a key."
},
{
"k": "15471",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I don't see any skin or blood under here."
},
{
"k": "15472",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[non-commital]Hm."
},
{
"k": "15473",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Nail polish is pretty garish. Not your style, Snow."
},
{
"k": "15474",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Looks that way. Also, it means it's not a perfect match to your arm."
},
{
"k": "15475",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "She uses mundy drugs?"
},
{
"k": "15476",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Track marks."
},
{
"k": "15477",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Not there."
},
{
"k": "15478",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Fairly intricate tattoo, here. I assume you don't have one?"
},
{
"k": "15479",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Shouldn't the glamour be concealing things like that if it's making her look like me?"
},
{
"k": "15480",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "It's possible it's designed not to."
},
{
"k": "15481",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Designed not to hide track marks?"
},
{
"k": "15482",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Good point"
},
{
"k": "15483",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Hm."
},
{
"k": "15484",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Are you wearing silk lingerie today, Snow?"
},
{
"k": "15485",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[emphatic]No."
},
{
"k": "15486",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Clothes aren't exact, then. Just the top layer."
},
{
"k": "15487",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Looks like she had help with the choice."
},
{
"k": "15488",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[wtf]From whom?"
},
{
"k": "15489",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Here's the perfume."
},
{
"k": "15490",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Bottle of your favorite perfume."
},
{
"k": "15491",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "How do you know what my favorite perfume is?"
},
{
"k": "15492",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Small wooden box…"
},
{
"k": "15493",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I hate these things, I can never figure out how to get them open."
},
{
"k": "15494",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Here, give it to me."
},
{
"k": "15495",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "So, what do you think? Who is she? And why does she look like me?"
},
{
"k": "15496",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "It's the worst kind of theft."
},
{
"k": "15497",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I'm glad it isn't you."
},
{
"k": "15498",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Useful."
},
{
"k": "15499",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Charming."
},
{
"k": "15500",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Tolerable."
},
{
"k": "15501",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Amazing."
},
{
"k": "15502",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "When we know who, we'll know what it means."
},
{
"k": "15503",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Anything going on in your personal life?"
},
{
"k": "15504",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "How many people know you're alive?"
},
{
"k": "15505",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Stay out of sight."
},
{
"k": "15506",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Tied up voluntarily."
},
{
"k": "15507",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Hands were held some other way."
},
{
"k": "15508",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "She was already dead."
},
{
"k": "15509",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "It might be a cheap one."
},
{
"k": "15510",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "It might be failing."
},
{
"k": "15511",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "It might be designed not to."
},
{
"k": "15512",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Could be."
},
{
"k": "15513",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Might be the glamour failing."
},
{
"k": "15514",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Possibly an injury."
},
{
"k": "15515",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "No, I'll hang on to it."
},
{
"k": "15516",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "She's a prostitute."
},
{
"k": "15517",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "She's a spy."
},
{
"k": "15518",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "She's a thief."
},
{
"k": "15519",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "She's a warning."
},
{
"k": "15520",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[upset and waving the box at Bigby]Why would someone kill her, then, Bigby? How about that? Why?"
},
{
"k": "15521",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[upset]Oh thanks, that's terrific. So, I'm the blue plate special on the menu at the local cathouse, now, am I?  Fantastic."
},
{
"k": "15522",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[frustrated and upset]Damn this box!"
},
{
"k": "15523",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[upset]Not \"just\" like Faith. Faith wasn't magically gimmicked up to look like exactly like me."
},
{
"k": "15524",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Not that we know of."
},
{
"k": "15525",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Miss White, you hardly--"
},
{
"k": "15526",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I think she's a prostitute. Just like Faith."
},
{
"k": "15527",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I could try--"
},
{
"k": "15528",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Part of the fantasy."
},
{
"k": "15529",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Actually meant to kill you."
},
{
"k": "15530",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Serial killer targeting prostitutes."
},
{
"k": "15531",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I just don't know, Snow, I'm sorry."
},
{
"k": "15532",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[disbelief] Wh-- oh my god."
},
{
"k": "15533",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "This photograph was in my apartment. It was on the piano, I thought I lost it. But… here it is."
},
{
"k": "15534",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[verge of tears]Bigby, I, what if I, what if it's my fault? What if she… was…"
},
{
"k": "15535",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "There's a picture of me."
},
{
"k": "15536",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Right this way."
},
{
"k": "15537",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[looking over at TJ]That's right, my lad."
},
{
"k": "15538",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Oh, I see."
},
{
"k": "15539",
"who": "TJ",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[awe]Is that the Witching Well?"
},
{
"k": "15540",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[still looking at TJ]No need to be scared of it, it's just a great big hole full of nothing. Like your grandmama."
},
{
"k": "15541",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "This is the boy who found it. Her. This is the boy."
},
{
"k": "15542",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[please don't send us to the farm]Hallo, Bigby. Er… I'm here because this is my son, obviously."
},
{
"k": "15543",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[mostly at ease]Hallo, then, Bigby. I've brought my son to do his civic duty."
},
{
"k": "15544",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[quietly, meant for only bigby to hear]Do we really have to involve him in this?"
},
{
"k": "15545",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[curt]Sheriff. I didn't realize you'd be here. I was told to bring the boy down."
},
{
"k": "15546",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "How old is he?"
},
{
"k": "15547",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "What's his name?"
},
{
"k": "15548",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "We call him TJ."
},
{
"k": "15549",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "You know, for, ah, Toad, Junior."
},
{
"k": "15550",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "He's six."
},
{
"k": "15551",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "You bring that kid all the way over here without a glamour?"
},
{
"k": "15552",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Aw, come on, General, don't start. I had a poncho on him, people just think he's an ugly kid.  It's New York City, nobody sees anything."
},
{
"k": "15553",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Let's try to keep it that way, OK?"
},
{
"k": "15554",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I read you."
},
{
"k": "15555",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Let's try to keep it that way."
},
{
"k": "15556",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "It's not OK."
},
{
"k": "15557",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "We'll discuss this later."
},
{
"k": "15558",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "That's not a risk I'm prepared to have you keep taking on everyone's behalf."
},
{
"k": "15559",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "We're going to talk about this later."
},
{
"k": "15560",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "It's OK, I won't bite."
},
{
"k": "15561",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "You can come on out."
},
{
"k": "15562",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "You don't have to hide."
},
{
"k": "15563",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I'm sorry about what happened before."
},
{
"k": "15564",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I'm sorry about what happened yesterday. It was an accident. OK?"
},
{
"k": "15565",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "It won't happen again."
},
{
"k": "15566",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Hey, Buddy!"
},
{
"k": "15567",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Hey, TJ!"
},
{
"k": "15568",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Hey there… kid."
},
{
"k": "15569",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "My name is Bigby."
},
{
"k": "15570",
"who": "TJ",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "You're the big bad wolf. My dad says so."
},
{
"k": "15571",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "My name is Bigby. What's yours?"
},
{
"k": "15572",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "TJ, my name is Bigby."
},
{
"k": "15573",
"who": "TJ",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Are you the big bad wolf?"
},
{
"k": "15574",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Not anymore"
},
{
"k": "15575",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Sometimes"
},
{
"k": "15576",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Not today"
},
{
"k": "15577",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Not today I'm not. Fair enough?"
},
{
"k": "15578",
"who": "TJ",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[dubious]I guess…"
},
{
"k": "15579",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I need you to be a big boy."
},
{
"k": "15580",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I need you to be a big boy now, can you do that?"
},
{
"k": "15581",
"who": "TJ",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[miffed; he already is a big boy] I'm seven and a quarter."
},
{
"k": "15582",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Tell me about finding the woman."
},
{
"k": "15583",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I want you to tell me about when you found the woman, OK?"
},
{
"k": "15584",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I have a problem."
}
]